WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:02.780
We have a voicemail number.

00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:05.370
That number is two one nine two David P..

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:08.020
Here's an interesting voicemail that came
in this morning.

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:11.100
David, this is was off again.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:15.490
You know, I'm actually very nervous about
this election.

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:18.250
Do you think your brother.

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:22.150
This matter was for Trump?

00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:24.590
Because we'll never get a dictatorship to
democracy.

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:25.590
It's terrifying.

00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:27.509
Democracy is dead.

00:00:27.509 --> 00:00:34.200
And I have my granddaughter, who's around
nine months old, is going to grow up and finally

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.520
give the country united.

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:36.790
Good morning.

00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:40.790
Thanks for all your reporting and good luck.

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:43.130
They say stay healthy.

00:00:43.130 --> 00:00:44.480
OK.

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:47.010
So but listen, I get the frustration.

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:53.760
We have a president with dictatorial authoritarian
tendencies and a sort of wish for that.

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:55.900
He's a wannabe.

00:00:55.900 --> 00:01:01.280
You are correct that many of the democratic
institutions of this country are in crisis

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:03.390
and they are in jeopardy.

00:01:03.390 --> 00:01:09.490
But to go further right now and to say this
is a dictatorship is is simply not accurate.

00:01:09.490 --> 00:01:14.469
I do think it's important to be, on the one
hand, warning people about signs and symptoms.

00:01:14.469 --> 00:01:16.619
But on the other hand, we don't want to be
hyperbolic.

00:01:16.619 --> 00:01:17.619
But the frustration.

00:01:17.619 --> 00:01:19.140
I'm with you.

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:22.130
We have an opportunity to do something about
it very soon.

00:01:22.130 --> 00:01:23.630
Let's actually do it.

